00:00:02.903 --> 00:00:03.603
MARIA: WELCOME BACK BREAKING

00:00:03.604 --> 00:00:04.106
MARIA: WELCOME BACK BREAKING

00:00:04.108 --> 00:00:05.584
NEWS THIS MORNING ON A STORY

00:00:05.618 --> 00:00:07.077
THAT WE HAVE BEEN FOLLOWING A

00:00:07.111 --> 00:00:08.242
PROFESSOR AT CASE WESTERN

00:00:08.243 --> 00:00:09.843
RESERVE UNIVERSITY IN CLEVELAND

00:00:09.844 --> 00:00:11.634
HAS BEEN ARRESTED OVER HIS

00:00:11.668 --> 00:00:13.288
ALLEGED FINANCIAL TIES TO CHINA.

00:00:13.322 --> 00:00:15.529
THIS JUST DAYS AFTER THE FBI

00:00:15.531 --> 00:00:17.331
SOUNDED THE ALARM ON CHINA’S

00:00:17.332 --> 00:00:18.297
ATTEMPT TO STEAL CORONAVIRUS

00:00:18.298 --> 00:00:18.611
RESEARCH.

00:00:18.645 --> 00:00:20.666
A PROFESSOR AT THE UNIVERSITY OF

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:22.339
ARKANSAS WAS ARRESTED ON SIMILAR

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:25.228
CHARGES LAST WEEK, AND THEN IN

00:00:25.262 --> 00:00:26.610
JANUARY, HARVARD’S CHEMISTRY

00:00:26.611 --> 00:00:28.226
CHIEF WAS CHARGED WITH FAILING

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:30.145
TO DISCLOSE HE TOO WAS BEING

00:00:30.146 --> 00:00:31.132
PAID BY THE CHINESE COMMUNIST

00:00:31.133 --> 00:00:31.532
PARTY.

00:00:31.533 --> 00:00:33.694
TWO WEEKS AGO SENATOR TOM COTTON

00:00:33.695 --> 00:00:36.805
TOLD US THAT THE  CCP WAS TRYING

00:00:36.806 --> 00:00:38.116
IN MANY WAYS TO STEAL MEDICAL

00:00:38.117 --> 00:00:39.688
DATA FROM THE UNITED STATES TO

00:00:39.689 --> 00:00:41.620
COME UP WITH A VACCINE FOR

00:00:41.654 --> 00:00:42.500
COVID-19 BEFORE THE UNITED

00:00:42.534 --> 00:00:42.979
STATES.

00:00:43.013 --> 00:00:45.729
MY SETDOWN WITH PRESIDENT TRUMP

00:00:45.730 --> 00:00:46.297
INCLUDED THIS.

00:00:46.331 --> 00:00:48.669
WE DISCUSSED IP THEFT AND THE

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:51.792
PANDEMIC’S IMPACT OF HIS

00:00:51.793 --> 00:00:54.099
RELATIONSHIP WITH CHINA AND

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:54.493
XI-JINPING.

00:00:54.528 --> 00:00:56.591
&gt;&gt;  SECRETARY POMPEO SAID HE HAD

00:00:56.593 --> 00:00:57.649
STRONG EVIDENCE IT DID COME FROM

00:00:57.683 --> 00:00:58.201
THE LAB.

00:00:58.236 --> 00:01:00.492
WE’VE BEEN REPORTING THIS EVERY

00:01:00.493 --> 00:01:02.315
SUNDAY BY THE WAY FROM EARLY ON.

00:01:02.316 --> 00:01:03.375
YOU ALSO SAID THAT YOU SAW

00:01:03.410 --> 00:01:03.998
EVIDENCE.

00:01:03.999 --> 00:01:05.942
CAN YOU TELL US ANYTHING ABOUT

00:01:05.944 --> 00:01:06.346
THE INTELLIGENCE?

00:01:06.380 --> 00:01:07.739
PRESIDENT TRUMP: NO BUT WE HAVE

00:01:07.773 --> 00:01:09.160
A LOT OF INFORMATION, AND IT’S

00:01:09.162 --> 00:01:10.567
NOT GOOD, BUT YOU KNOW THE WORST

00:01:10.569 --> 00:01:12.049
OF ALL WHETHER IT CAME FROM THE

00:01:12.083 --> 00:01:13.844
LAB OR  CAME FROM THE BATS,

00:01:13.879 --> 00:01:15.450
IT ALL CAME FROM CHINA, AND THEY

00:01:15.485 --> 00:01:16.533
SHOULD HAVE STOPPED IT.

00:01:16.567 --> 00:01:17.719
THEY COULD HAVE STOPPED IT AT

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:18.650
THAT SOURCE.

00:01:18.651 --> 00:01:20.454
I CALL IT THE SOURCE.

00:01:20.455 --> 00:01:21.138
RIGHT THERE.

00:01:21.173 --> 00:01:23.006
MARIA: BUT HIS DECISION TO ALLOW

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:24.014
