00:01:24.048 --> 00:01:25.195
PRESIDENT TRUMP: I DON’T KNOW IF

00:01:25.230 --> 00:01:26.247
THEY MADE THE DECISION BUT IT

00:01:26.248 --> 00:01:27.659
GOT OUT OF CONTROL.

00:01:27.693 --> 00:01:29.582
I THINK MORE LIKELY IT GOT OUT

00:01:29.616 --> 00:01:30.286
OF CONTROL.

00:01:30.287 --> 00:01:31.846
MARIA: SENATOR COTTON SAID THEY

00:01:31.848 --> 00:01:33.816
DIDN’T WANT THE CHINESE ECONOMY

00:01:33.817 --> 00:01:35.668
TO CONTRACT 20% AND THE REST OF

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:36.844
THE WORLD TO CONTRACT 2%.

00:01:36.845 --> 00:01:37.958
PRESIDENT TRUMP: SO WE WERE

00:01:37.992 --> 00:01:38.753
BEATING THEM VERY BADLY BEFORE

00:01:38.754 --> 00:01:39.132
THIS.

00:01:39.166 --> 00:01:40.744
WE WERE BEATING THEM BETWEEN THE

00:01:40.745 --> 00:01:42.093
TARIFFS AND OTHER THINGS WE

00:01:42.094 --> 00:01:43.845
WERE DOING, AND WE WERE GOING UP

00:01:43.880 --> 00:01:44.959
AND THEY WERE HAVING A VERY BAD

00:01:44.960 --> 00:01:45.430
YEAR.

00:01:45.431 --> 00:01:47.368
THEY WERE HAVING THE WORST YEAR

00:01:47.402 --> 00:01:49.363
THEY’VE HAD IN 56 YEARS.

00:01:49.364 --> 00:01:52.325
MARIA: AND THEY HAD PROTESTERS

00:01:52.327 --> 00:01:53.195
ON THE STREETS.

00:01:53.229 --> 00:01:54.894
PRESIDENT TRUMP: BEYOND THAT WE

00:01:54.929 --> 00:01:56.670
WERE DOING WELL, HERE IS WHAT I

00:01:56.705 --> 00:01:58.170
KNOW FOR SURE.

00:01:58.205 --> 00:02:00.171
THEY DIDN’T ALLOW THIS WHOLE

00:02:00.172 --> 00:02:01.914
THING, THEY DIDN’T ALLOW PEOPLE

00:02:01.948 --> 00:02:03.521
TO GO INTO CHINA, BUT THEY DID

00:02:03.556 --> 00:02:05.892
ALLOW THEM TO GO OUT TO THE

00:02:05.894 --> 00:02:06.750
WORLD INCLUDING THE UNITED

00:02:06.784 --> 00:02:07.303
STATES.

00:02:07.304 --> 00:02:09.699
THAT’S WHY EUROPE IS A MESS.

00:02:09.734 --> 00:02:11.096
THAT’S WHY LOOK AT THESE

00:02:11.097 --> 00:02:11.563
COUNTRIES.

00:02:11.565 --> 00:02:13.634
RUSSIA IS HAVING A HARD TIME.

00:02:13.635 --> 00:02:15.447
EVERYBODY IS HAVING A HARD TIME.

00:02:15.481 --> 00:02:17.171
MARIA: WILL IT GET WORSE FOR
THOSE COUNTRIES DO YOU THINK

00:02:17.206 --> 00:02:19.924
THOSE COUNTRIES DO YOU THINK

