00:02:29.024 --> 00:02:29.213
PROCESS.

00:02:29.247 --> 00:02:30.131
WE’RE GETTING TOWARD THE END OF

00:02:30.132 --> 00:02:30.511
THE PROCESS.

00:02:30.512 --> 00:02:31.250
MARIA: SO THEY DOWNPLAYED THE

00:02:31.284 --> 00:02:32.019
